@startuml BookingAndPaymentSequence
title BloodLab Booking, Collector Workflow & Verified UPI Payment Sequence

actor "Customer" as Customer
boundary "Mobile / Web Client" as Client
control "BloodLab Backend API" as API
database "SQLite (lab.db)" as DB
actor "Authorised Admin" as Admin
actor "Phlebotomist (Collector)" as Collector

== 1. Registration with Real OTP Verification ==
Customer -> Client: Enter mobile number
Client -> API: POST /api/auth/otp/send {"phone": "9840123456"}
API -> DB: Save 6-digit OTP (10 min expiry)
API --> Client: {"message": "OTP sent", "dev_otp": "XXXXXX"}
Customer -> Client: Enter OTP + Name + WhatsApp + Email + Password
Client -> API: POST /api/auth/customer/register
API -> DB: Verify OTP record & insert Customer
API --> Client: Customer JWT (role='customer')

== 2. Booking with Immutable Snapshot ==
Customer -> Client: Select Apollo Diagnostics -> CBC (₹315.00)
Customer -> Client: Select collection slot & home address
Client -> API: POST /api/bookings
API -> DB: Store immutable snapshot of company, test, discounts & net price
API -> DB: Generate Booking Ref (BL-XXXX) and Invoice ID (INV-XXXX)
API --> Client: Booking created (Status: UNPAID, Collection: Not Assigned)

== 3. UPI QR Code Display & Payment Submission ==
Client -> API: GET /api/bookings/{id}/payment-details
API --> Client: Render dynamic UPI QR code + exact payable amount (₹315.00)
Customer -> Client: Pay via UPI & enter 12-digit UTR reference
Client -> API: POST /api/bookings/{id}/submit-payment {"transaction_reference": "UTR..."}
API -> DB: Set payment_status = 'pending' (Awaiting Admin verification)
API --> Client: Payment reference recorded

== 4. Admin Payment Verification & Reconciliation ==
Admin -> API: GET /api/admin/assignments
API --> Admin: Display pending payments with submitted UTR
Admin -> API: POST /api/admin/bookings/{id}/verify-payment {"action": "approve"}
API -> DB: Update payment_status = 'paid', record timestamp & admin ID
API -> DB: Log audit event

== 5. Download Official Tax PDF Receipt ==
Customer -> Client: Click "Download Receipt (PDF)"
Client -> API: GET /api/bookings/{id}/receipt.pdf
API -> DB: Verify payment_status == 'paid'
API -> API: ReportLab compiles official PDF receipt with QR code
API --> Client: Stream official PDF invoice

== 6. Collector Assignment & Authorized GPS Tracking ==
Admin -> API: POST /api/admin/bookings/{id}/assign {"collector_id": 2}
API -> DB: Set collection_status = 'Assigned'
Collector -> API: GET /api/collector/assignments
Collector -> API: PATCH /api/collector/bookings/{id}/status {"status": "Accepted"}
Collector -> API: PATCH /api/collector/bookings/{id}/status {"status": "On the Way"}
note over Collector, API: GPS Tracking Activated ONLY during active trip
loop Active Transit
    Collector -> API: POST /api/collector/bookings/{id}/location {"latitude": 13.08, "longitude": 80.27}
    Admin -> API: GET /api/admin/tracking (Plots live position on OpenStreetMap)
end
Collector -> API: PATCH /api/collector/bookings/{id}/status {"status": "Sample Collected"}
note over Collector, API: GPS Tracking Terminated Immediately. Stored coordinates cleared.

@enduml
